      "widgets_values": [
        "Dust & Spot Removal — heal small specks automatically.\n\nsample_dust.jpg is the sample portrait with synthetic sensor-dust specks added. The node finds small isolated dark spots (mode dark), skips lines and textured areas such as lashes and hair, and fills each spot from its surroundings. spot_size = largest spot in px, sensitivity = how faint a spot may be. For portraits a skin mask in mask is the safest setting."
